{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0054_1006_p", "source_sha256": "11a52c5417ed66630eb18d665e4b5b4460e931fce1efd8c7bbaa9b4d1ad3abb8", "ja": "不思議って、何がですか？", "zh": "不可思议？哪边不可思议呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_052kao0054_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_052kao0054_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "8c25099c42c19c1030f2d26f51de671fc7d96fcfc79933c1fa61299146846d66", "ja": "{$P$}さんって、どうしてこんなに\n女の子の気持ちがわかるのかしら？って。", "zh": "我想不通为什么{$P$}先生\n会这么懂女孩子的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
